  "cited_article_id": "configure-online-appointment-booking",
  "reply": "To enable online booking, go to **Settings > Patient Portal > Booking Rules** and turn on **Allow Online Appointment Booking**. Then, in **Scheduling > Visit Types**, edit each visit type you want patients to book and check **Available Online** (note that urgent visit types cannot be made online). Finally, set which staff accept online requests under **Settings > Schedule > Provider Availability**. Patients will only be able to book 24 hours to 60 days in advance. If a provider isn’t showing, make sure their schedule template is published and their rooms are active in **Settings > Facility > Rooms**."
}
